WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:18.140
Akatambi kano kannyonnyola engeri y’okuteekateeka omwana ne maama oba omulabirira nga tonnaba kukola kukebera kwa fundal ekitangaala ekimyufu ekidda okuva munda mu liiso mu baana abazaalibwa n’abakulu.

2
00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:29.140
Omwana alina okukwatibwa obulungi naye nga mulungi, oba ku kifuba, ku kibegabega, oba, bwe kiba bbebi, ng’agalamidde ku mugongo.

3
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:37.120
Kikulu gye bali okuwulira nga tebalina bulabe. Abalongo abato basobola obutawummula era bayinza okwetaaga okusiba ebizigo.

4
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.180
Okwekebejja nga wayiseewo akaseera katono ng’omaze okuliisa kiyinza okuyamba kuba zijja kuba ziwummudde ate nga zeebaka katono.

5
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:49.220
Abaana abakulu bayinza okusenga nga bazannya n’akazannyo okumala akaseera katono.

6
00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:55.320
Yogera n’eddoboozi ery’omukwano era fuba okukka wansi ku ddaala ly’amaaso gaabwe.

7
00:00:55.320 --> 00:01:00.500
Nnyonnyola ky’ogenda okukola era ofune okukkiriza nga tonnatandika.

8
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:10.440
Okusooka buuza maama oba omulabirira oba balabye ekikyamu ku liiso oba mu kulaba kw’omwana we era ebbanga lye bamaze okwetegereza ekizibu.

9
00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:15.120
Ekiddako, tunuulira omwana mu maaso n’amaaso ge. Weebuuze ebibuuzo ebimu.

10
00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:24.300
Omwana alabika alina obulumi mu liiso erimu oba gombi? Amaaso gazibu oba gasibye nnyo?

11
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:31.280
Waliwo okufukirira oba okufuluma mu maaso? Amaaso gali mu sayizi y’emu? Ebikowe by’amaaso bizimba?

12
00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:38.580
Kati, lowooza ku ngeri omwana gy’alabamu. Tambuza ffeesi yo mpola okuva ku ludda olumu okudda ku lulala, ng’otunuulira amaaso gaabwe.

13
00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:47.970
Kola akamwenyumwenyu akasirise. Omwana agoberera entambula ya ffeesi yo oba ayanukula akamwenyumwenyu ko akasirise?

14
00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:53.990
Nate weebuuze ebibuuzo ebimu. Amaaso gombi gatambula mu ddembe era nga gali wamu?

15
00:01:54.430 --> 00:02:01.110
Amaaso gagolokofu oba eriiso erimu likyuka munda oba ebweru? Amaaso gawuubaala?

16
00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:12.200
Osobola n’okukozesa amataala agali ku Arclight n’ebigendererwa by’ebifaananyi okufuna okufaayo n’okukebera omutindo gw’okulaba.

17
00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:20.660
Tambuza oludda lw’ogenderera okudda ku ludda, waggulu ne wansi. Tunuulira omwana atereeza era agoberera ekiruubirirwa.

18
00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:26.600
Basobola okutuuka n’okusonga mu butuufu ku kigendererwa?

19
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:35.060
Emirundi mingi, eriiso limu lyokka terisobola kulaba bulungi. Ggwe oba maama osobola okubikka eriiso erimu, olwo eddala.

20
00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:43.320
Tambuza ekigendererwa era geraageranya engeri omwana gy’akwatamu ng’okozesa amaaso gombi, olwo limu ku limu.

21
00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:51.380
Omwana bw’aba tayagala liiso erimu okubikkibwa, kiraga nti eriiso eritabikkiddwa terilaba bulungi nnyo.

22
00:02:51.560 --> 00:03:00.560
Bw’oba olowooza nti osobola okulaba ekikyamu ku liiso ery’ebweru, tunuulira nnyo ng’okozesa enkomerero ya loupe eya Arclight.

23
00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:12.150
Koleeza amataala ogende waggulu okumpi ne sentimita nga 6. Oyinza okwetaaga okukozesa engalo yo okuggulawo mpola ebikowe by’amaaso.

24
00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:24.070
Weebuuze ebibuuzo ebimu. Ekitundu ekyeru eky’eriiso kya pinki oba kimyufu? akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso oba cornea nzirugavu oba njeru?

25
00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:35.160
akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso ye round? Osobola okulaba emirambo gy’abagwira? Kati oli mwetegefu okukola ebigezo bya reflex.
